{"id":"15-1685-2-12","zh":"“据说这些卑劣的恶人，对我叫着‘爹啊，爹啊’；","confidence":72}
{"id":"15-1686-2-10","zh":"他们是装成儿子模样的罗刹，就像群狗拦住野猪一样。”","confidence":65}
{"id":"15-1687-2-20","zh":"由于见到复数的用例，又由于在《尼鲁提藏》（Niruttipiṭaka）中见到“sāno”等形式，所以用“sā，sā，sāno。","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-1687-21-24","zh":"sānaṃ，sāne。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-1687-25-34","zh":"sānā”等形式，讲述了表示“狗”的 sā 一词的名词变化表（nāmikapadamālā）。","confidence":78}
{"id":"15-1688-2-7","zh":"现在讲述 puma 一词的名词变化表：","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-1689-2-7","zh":"pumā，pumā，pumāno。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-8-11","zh":"pumānaṃ，pumāne。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-12-21","zh":"pumānā，pumunā，pumena，pumānehi，pumānebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-22-27","zh":"pumassa，pumuno，pumānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-28-35","zh":"pumānā，pumunā，pumānehi，pumānebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-36-41","zh":"pumassa，pumuno，pumānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-42-45","zh":"pumāne，pumānesu。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1689-46-53","zh":"bho puma，bhavanto pumā，pumāno。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-1689-54-64","zh":"复数也可以作“bho pumā”，这种用法也应当了解。","confidence":82}
{"id":"15-1690-2-5","zh":"不过，在这里——","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1691-2-12","zh":"“他只会生女儿，家族中不会生出男子；","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-1692-2-12","zh":"如果有人明知答案，被问到问题时却作出不实的解答。”","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-1693-2-19","zh":"这段圣典证明 puma 一词有复数形式。在《迦旃延文法》中，可以见到带随鼻音的呼格单数“he pumaṃ”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-1693-20-31","zh":"但由于在许多圣典段落和义注中都见不到带随鼻音的呼格形式，所以我在这里不列出。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-1693-32-37","zh":"经过审察，如果认为合理，就可以采用。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1693-38-56","zh":"至于“Yasassi naṃ paññavantaṃ visayhā”这一句，应当理解为：其中的随鼻音是为了维持韵律而按增音规则加上的，并不是本来就有的。","confidence":72}
{"id":"15-1693-57-61","zh":"这是按以 ā 结尾的方式列出的名词变化表。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1694-2-5","zh":"“在一万六千名女子之中，","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1695-2-6","zh":"当时没有一个男子；","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1696-2-3","zh":"经过了一些日日夜夜，","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-1697-2-8","zh":"只生下我一个男子。”还有，","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-1698-2-11","zh":"“正如在鹤类之中，从来没有雄性；","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-1699-2-12","zh":"每当云中雷声响起，雌鹤就在那时受孕。”","confidence":78}
{"id":"15-1700-2-8","zh":"由于见到这些圣典用例，也应当了解按以 o 结尾的方式列出的名词变化表。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-1701-2-5","zh":"pumo，pumā。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-6-9","zh":"pumaṃ，pume。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-10-15","zh":"pumena，pumehi，pumebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-16-19","zh":"pumassa，pumānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-20-29","zh":"pumā，pumasmā，pumamhā，pumehi，pumebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-30-33","zh":"pumassa，pumānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-34-41","zh":"pume，pumasmiṃ，pumamhi，pumesu。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1701-42-47","zh":"bho puma，bhavanto pumā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-1701-48-63","zh":"也可以作“bho pumā”。这样，puma 一词就有两种名词变化表。","confidence":82}
{"id":"15-1702-2-5","zh":"现在讲述混合的变化方式：","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1703-2-10","zh":"pumā，pumo，pumā，pumāno。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-11-18","zh":"pumānaṃ，pumaṃ，pumāne，pume。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-19-32","zh":"pumānā，pumunā，pumena，pumānehi，pumānebhi，pumehi，pumebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-33-38","zh":"pumassa，pumuno，pumānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-39-56","zh":"pumānā，pumunā，pumā，pumasmā，pumamhā，pumānehi，pumānebhi，pumehi，pumebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-57-62","zh":"pumassa，pumuno，pumānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-63-74","zh":"pumāne，pume，pumasmiṃ，pumamhi，pumānesu，pumesu。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1703-75-83","zh":"bho puma，bhavanto pumāno，bhavanto pumā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-1703-84-95","zh":"也可以作“bho pumāno，bho pumā”。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-1704-2-7","zh":"现在讲述 raha 一词的名词变化表：","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-1705-2-5","zh":"rahā 指的是恶法。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-1705-6-11","zh":"rahā，rahā，rahino。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1705-12-15","zh":"rahānaṃ，rahāne。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1705-16-21","zh":"rahinā，rahinehi，rahinebhi。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1705-22-25","zh":"rahassa，rahānaṃ。","confidence":92}
{"id":"15-1705-26-31","zh":"rahā，rahānehi，rahānebhi。","confidence":92}
